      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Mid-Decade Redistricting Shifts",
      "description": "California, Missouri, North Carolina, and Texas will use different congressional maps in 2026 than in 2024 due to voluntary mid-decade redistricting — unusual, and worth watching for how it shifts competitive-district counts.",
      "x": 1184,
