      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Misunderstood Pace of Government",
      "description": "Constituents misjudge who holds which powers and how fast government was designed to move, so legitimate slowness reads as failure — and stretched congressional staff can't give every issue the weight visitors expect.",
      "x": 23488.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-27",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_30bec81c-e61c-46f1-9614-a77b5ec9e6a7",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "No Playbook for Good Citizenship",
      "description": "There is no clear guide to the daily, weekly, and monthly steps of being an informed, participating citizen — the information is scattered everywhere, and the whole project feels overwhelming.",
      "x": 23784.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-29",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_0b028977-7602-496b-8bc9-78c39e4b57eb",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Broad Civic Disengagement",
      "description": "Many people are not engaged in local or national politics, don't know who the candidates are or what they stand for, and don't vote — despite candidate forums and get-out-the-vote efforts.",
      "x": 24080.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-30",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_7854b82e-0e42-4294-b6e0-70859ceb38c5",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Missing Dialogue Across Difference",
      "description": "People who hold differing views about a topic rarely talk with each other; new civic-engagement software is being tried, with only some success.",
      "x": 22896.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-31",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_14dd9cba-1775-4991-beb8-0bbbf439c250",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Ranked-Choice Confusion Persists",
      "description": "Voters remain confused about how ranked choice voting works and still lack clear, unbiased information about the candidates themselves.",
      "x": 24968.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-34",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_29b8547c-abbc-466f-8cd4-f133efa80068",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Anemic, Uneven Participation",
      "description": "Civic participation is thin, and only some voices get heard and lifted.",
      "x": 21120.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-35",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_fabbcf9a-008c-4c8e-876c-d5946564bee0",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Constituent Mail Black Hole",
      "description": "Letters and emails to representatives feel like talking into a void — heartfelt messages come back as generic, strategist-polished boilerplate.",
      "x": 22008.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-36",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_62c445ad-bba7-425d-aaae-4628a213076c",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Complacency & Candidate Deterrence",
      "description": "The average citizen doesn't feel they can make a difference, and good people stay away from political office because media can form any narrative it wants about them.",
      "x": 20528.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-38",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_c63b6eeb-9349-48bb-9b15-af16d0173bc4",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Mid-Decade Redistricting Shifts",
      "description": "California, Missouri, North Carolina, and Texas will use different congressional maps in 2026 than in 2024 due to voluntary mid-decade redistricting — unusual, and worth watching for how it shifts competitive-district counts.",
      "x": 28224.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-42",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_bf8da9c2-3b30-46f6-a830-d05afbd4fe6c",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Accountability for Public Lies",
      "description": "Telling the truth — and holding liars accountable and responsible — is named as the missing piece of civic life.",
      "x": 28816.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-43",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_82c2f10e-9688-4474-8536-49ae0179f625",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Cross-Agency Coordination Failure",
      "description": "Constituent problems take years to solve because coordinating local, federal, and neighboring-state agencies, private entities, and residents is nearly impossible — stakeholders claim jurisdiction for credit and duck it for problem-solving, at great cost to unpaid commissioners.",
      "x": 20824.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-44",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_913adf4d-c95d-46bb-82cf-56b787c3ceab",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Representatives Without Accountability",
      "description": "Representatives don't seem to answer to the people, and replacing them changes little — new reps inherit the same voting patterns, with the two-party system and polarization at the crux.",
      "x": 29112.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-46",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_aaa94372-8cc3-4a50-9bea-e2e1222e0d31",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Last-Mile Resource Disconnect",
      "description": "Programs, grants, and services exist on paper, but communities often don't know about them or can't navigate them — the gap is grassroots outreach, trusted local partners, and hands-on navigation support, not new programs.",
      "x": 25856.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-47",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "@id": "item_1fc0b5e9-e936-4dbf-91c4-c653832d9683",
      "@type": "tg:SourceExtract",
      "type": "Source Extract",
      "tier": 0,
      "title": "Campus–Neighborhood Disconnection",
      "description": "There is no single, easy channel for a university community and its neighbors to trade information and opportunities — student jobs, local events, programs, and campus resources live in scattered slices.",
      "x": 21416.57543712731,
      "y": 280,
      "w": 240,
      "h": 110,
      "verified": false,
      "strong": false,
      "source_url": "https://theupskillinglabs.org/survey/civics/results#r-48",
      "children": []
